<title>USA: Typhoon threatens shipping off Marianas - WSC.</title>
<headline>Typhoon threatens shipping off Marianas - WSC.</headline>
<dateline>LEXINGTON, Mass. 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Typhoon Carlo threatens shipping off the Mariana Islands, private forecaster Weather Services Corporation (WSC) said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The storm, off the northern Marianas and moving west northwest at 10 mph, has top winds of 75 mph.</p>
<p>It will bring squally conditions near the islands during the next 12 hours, before it moves away from the region and conditions improve.</p>
</text>
